            "review_title": "Review at Teppan Shu - Ho Chi Minh Restaurant",
            "review_text": "ArtistKev\nBrisbane, Australia108 contributions\n0\nGreat food and drinks HCM city\nAug 2019 • Solo\nI was looking for Mexican to fire my taste buds. This restraint was not far from my hotel so I arrived and was welcomed by the staff. Margaritas seemed like a good Mexican starter then into tacos beans and rice all were well prepared and hot with balanced spices and the correct heat for my palette. I finished of my drinks with a Mexican mule. By this stage the chef arrived to help me find my way home and his directions were perfect. Now I can sleep in a comfortable bed. All the staff wanted to make me feel at home and enjoy the evening. It worked. It is well worth a visit. It is clean and food is fresh. I will return.\nRead more\nWritten August 8, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
