            "review_title": "Review at Teppan Shu - Ho Chi Minh Restaurant",
            "review_text": "RayBabin\nSherbrooke, Canada108 contributions\n0\nIf your hotel is near the airport, try this restaurant\nApr 2018 • Couples\nVery close to the airport, this Italian restaurant is well worth the visit. It's a bit pricey for Vietnam but the food is excellent and they have a pretty good selection. The meat lasagna was done with a white sauce instead of the traditional tomato sauce, different but still good.\nWritten April 4, 2018",
